User Interface Features:

   * 128 data entry fields per screen
   * Picture masks
   * Picture functions
   * Range limits supported for date and numeric fields
   * Unlimited data input validation
   * Pop-up four-function calculator
   * Automatic mouse support
   * Box drawing
   * Window management
   * Moving bar menus with optional "Lotus" style help
   * Dialog boxes
   * Progress bars
   * Pick lists
   * Tag lists
   * Screen savers
   * User/programmer defined context-sensitive help system
   * Support for screens created with the SAYWHAT?! screen generator


Database Files:

   * Standard format dBASE III+ database files with memo field support
   * Default configuration allows up to 33 open database files
   * Up to 2.1 billion records per file (limited by disk space)
   * Maximum record size: 4000 Bytes
   * Maximum number of fields per file: 128
   * Maximum field size: 254 bytes
   * Proprietary index file format
   * Up to 16 indexes per database


Virtual Files:

   * EMS, and XMS memory support
   * Variable length records
   * Database, Text, or Binary data storage


Time and Date:

   * Date range from 01/01/0001 to 12/31/9999
   * Time Formats HH:MM:SS, HH:MM, MM:SS
   * Date Formats: American, ANSI, British, German, Italian, Spanish, French,
                   French Canadian (Quebec), Russian
   * On-screen interrupt driven clock display
   * Pop-up interactive calendar
   * Fuzzy date support
   * SetEpochTo()

Database Browser: 

   * Windowable
   * Programmable
   * Recursive
   * Virtual fields
   * Calculated fields

Printing:

   * Print spooler
   * Page printing
   * Box and line drawing
   * Report generator
   * Laser printer support


Utilities:

    CREATE.EXE     Database structure creation and modification utility
    MAKECODE.EXE   Template-driven program/code generator
    REPGEN.EXE     Report specification generator
    BROWSE.EXE     Database browser/editor
    DISPSTRU.EXE   Database structure display utility
    HELPEDIT.EXE   Help database editor
    COLORMAP.EXE   Application color map utility
    INSTALL.EXE    Source code included

Requirements:

     Borland C/C++, Turbo C/C++, or Microsoft C
     IBM PC/XT/AT, PS/2, or compatible computer
     MS-DOS or PC-DOS 3.1 or higher

Price:    $299.   Includes source and library files for use with Borland and
                  Microsoft compilers, and utilities.

